    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Singapore.png
  - name: 🇺🇸 美国节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇺🇸|美国|美國|美西|美东|美東|洛杉矶|洛杉磯|圣何塞|聖何塞|硅谷|矽谷|西雅图|西雅圖|旧金山|舊金山|纽约|紐約|芝加哥|达拉斯|達拉斯|凤凰城|鳳凰城|迈阿密|邁阿密|亚特兰大|亞特蘭大|华盛顿|華盛頓|波特兰|波特蘭|拉斯维加斯|德克萨斯|德克薩斯|德州|加州|弗吉尼亚|俄勒冈|United[ _-]?States|UnitedStates|America|Los[ _-]?Angeles|San[ _-]?Jose|Silicon[ _-]?Valley|Seattle|San[ _-]?Francisco|New[ _-]?York|Chicago|Dallas|Phoenix|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Miami)(?![A-Za-z])|Atlanta|Ashburn|Portland|Las[ _-]?Vegas|Denver|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Texas)(?![A-Za-z])|California|Virginia|Oregon|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:US|USA|LAX|SJC|SFO|SEA|JFK|EWR|ORD|DFW|MIA|IAD|PHX|ATL)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!南|拉|完|欧|歐|审|審|赞|讚|精)美(?!洲|元|食|女|妙)
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
    interval: 300
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    timeout: 5000
    expected-status: 204
    hidden: true
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/United_States.png
  - name: 🇰🇷 韩国节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇰🇷|韩国|韓國|首尔|首爾|春川|釜山|仁川|南韩|南韓|South[ _-]?Korea|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Korea)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Seoul)(?![A-Za-z])|Chuncheon|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Busan)(?![A-Za-z])|Incheon|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:KR|KOR|ICN|SEL)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!北)韩|(?<!北)韓
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
