  - IP-CIDR,100.64.0.0/10,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连,no-resolve
  - IP-CIDR6,fd7a:115c:a1e0::/48,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连,no-resolve
  - DST-PORT,41641,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,argotunnel.com,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cftunnel.com,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cfargotunnel.com,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DST-PORT,7844,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zerotier.com,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DST-PORT,9993,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - RULE-SET,geosite-openai,🤖 OpenAI / ChatGPT
  - RULE-SET,geosite-category-ai--cn,✨ AI 服务
  - RULE-SET,geosite-telegram,✈️ Telegram
  - RULE-SET,geosite-twitter,𝕏 X / Twitter
  - RULE-SET,geosite-discord,💬 Discord
  - RULE-SET,geosite-youtube,▶️ YouTube
  - RULE-SET,geosite-netflix,🎬 Netflix
