  - name: 🇫🇷 法国节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇫🇷|法国|法國|巴黎|马赛|馬賽|里昂|斯特拉斯堡|France|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Paris)(?![A-Za-z])|Marseille|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Lyon)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:FR|CDG|PAR|MRS)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!方|算|语|語|魔|无|無|非|说|說|办|辦|用|玩|看)法(?!律|规|規|兰克福|蘭克福)
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
    interval: 300
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    timeout: 5000
    expected-status: 204
    hidden: true
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/France.png
  - name: 🇳🇱 荷兰节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇳🇱|荷兰|荷蘭|阿姆斯特丹|鹿特丹|Netherlands|Holland|Amsterdam|Rotterdam|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:NL|NLD|AMS)(?![A-Za-z])
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
    interval: 300
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    timeout: 5000
    expected-status: 204
    hidden: true
  - name: 🇨🇦 加拿大节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇨🇦|加拿大|多伦多|多倫多|温哥华|溫哥華|蒙特利尔|蒙特利爾|渥太华|Canada|Toronto|Vancouver|Montreal|Ottawa|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:CA|CAN|YYZ|YVR|YUL)(?![A-Za-z])
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
    interval: 300
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    timeout: 5000
    expected-status: 204
    hidden: true
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Canada.png
  - name: 🇦🇺 澳大利亚节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇦🇺|澳大利亚|澳大利亞|澳洲|悉尼|墨尔本|墨爾本|布里斯班|珀斯|Australia|Sydney|Melbourne|Brisbane|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:Perth)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:AU|AUS|SYD|MEL)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!港)澳(?!门|門)
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
    interval: 300
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    timeout: 5000
    expected-status: 204
    hidden: true
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Australia.png
