  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,level3.blizzard.com,🎮 游戏下载直连
  - RULE-SET,catalog-infra-tunnel-direct,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.com,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.io,🔗 局域网与内网穿透直连
