  - RULE-SET,geosite-steam,🎮 Steam
  - RULE-SET,geosite-category-games,🕹️ 游戏平台
  - RULE-SET,geosite-speedtest,⏱️ 测速工具
  - RULE-SET,geosite-gfw,🌐 GFW 代理
  - RULE-SET,geoip-telegram,🧭 常用服务 IP,no-resolve
  - RULE-SET,geoip-google,🧭 常用服务 IP,no-resolve
  - RULE-SET,geoip-netflix,🧭 常用服务 IP,no-resolve
