  - name: 🇭🇰 香港节点
    type: url-test
    use:
      - slot-main
    filter: (?i)🇭🇰|香港|深港|沪港|滬港|京港|广港|廣港|港线|港線|港服|Hong[ _-]?Kong|HongKong|Hong-Kong|Hong_Kong|(?<![A-Za-z])(?:HK|HKG)(?![A-Za-z])|(?<!东|東|空|海)(?<!连云|連雲|防城|张家|張家|高雄)(?<!鹿特丹|新加坡)港(?!口|台)
    url: https://cp.cloudflare.com/generate_204
    interval: 300
    tolerance: 50
    lazy: true
    timeout: 5000
    expected-status: 204
    hidden: true
    icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Hong_Kong.png
  - name: 🇹🇼 台湾节点
