  - RULE-SET,geosite-bilibili,📺 哔哩哔哩港澳台
  - RULE-SET,geosite-spotify,🎵 Spotify
  - RULE-SET,geosite-tiktok,🎵 TikTok
  - RULE-SET,geosite-github,🐙 GitHub
  - RULE-SET,geosite-googlefcm,🔔 Google FCM
  - RULE-SET,geosite-google,🔍 Google
  - RULE-SET,geosite-apple,🍎 Apple
  - RULE-SET,geosite-onedrive,☁️ OneDrive
  - RULE-SET,geosite-microsoft,🪟 Microsoft
  - RULE-SET,geosite-steam,🎮 Steam
  - RULE-SET,geosite-category-games,🕹️ 游戏平台
